      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Sign in to Dreamina in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → Dreamina → Dreamina Settings**.\n2. In **Host**, upload `example_workflows/assets/dreamina/host.webp` from this pack's folder: the host **image-01-design-a-host** made. Or upload a picture of your own host.\n3. In **Pose**, say how to redraw them. `{{image1}}` stands for the picture.\n4. Press **Run**. The new picture is saved under `image/dreamina`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
